X:1
T:Mae Gwahoddiad (version 2)
R:carol Plygain
B:Llyfr Hen Garolau Cymru
S:Sent by Steve Jeans
N:A Plygain carol in three parts, with the tune in the middle part, as in most Plygain carols. Four verses are commonly sung.
N:Headed "Eos Powys" in the book, mesur (metre) Mentra Gwen.
M:4/4
L:1/4
%%score 1 2 3
V:1 treble nm="T"
V:2 treble nm="A"
V:3 bass nm="B"
K:G
